<title>POLAND: Polish broad money supply rises 0.8 pct Feb 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish broad money supply rises 0.8 pct Feb 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's broad money supply rose by 1.11 billion zlotys, or 0.8 percent, in the February 1-10 period to 137.16 billion after a 0.1 pct rise in January, preliminary central bank figures showed.</p>
</text>
